"senti, Morgana...?"

#: scenario7:scenario7_992E7B91_DD8C_4CFF_BE91_EDCFE80267E8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b48d649e03270b9708e15d296416919205c34d5ff1b469cb7b21601f25e8b390
#. default-sha256: dd482ae16890a8c417567ccf2e17ec9c749923dc25efbc3d85d055211c9a7473
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_992E7B91_DD8C_4CFF_BE91_EDCFE80267E8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I can hear you just fine, my dear.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Now, what brings you all the way "
"up here?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Riesco a sentirti benissimo, mio caro.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Allora, cosa ti porta fin qui?"

#: scenario7:scenario7_871311D2_CE60_4D24_BA59_92D10EF42D9B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bc77ce1ba3cfda7a9bace4f333b624cb711fe867398714b2174f2a192f535aaa
#. default-sha256: 37b6db306f48da3ffeb0b9660de449b0364bed988e1b4a554df4dd4455dee62d
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_871311D2_CE60_4D24_BA59_92D10EF42D9B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You know you can call me from anywhere in the house.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫My bonds to this tower have "
"been broken."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Lo sai che puoi chiamarmi da qualunque altra parte della casa.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ciò che mi vincolava "
"a questa torre è stato spezzato."

#: scenario7:scenario7_E05ECFDB_24A1_463F_AB5C_00E1A7656DB3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fb345c0d14fb4374141306d34a41a71756446ecd4df32a2452ac0ef906da631d
