#: scenario7:scenario7_CA3F6677_C063_4924_BF31_AA028A2DFDB8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ef0f62ccb3379f36d31d896aba696197671d008a92b0ceb2f7d35cf5c20d4157
#. default-sha256: bcff662fbfea72d2a46188261f6e6bf56984a1cff7c018efe3c916de210c5d68
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_CA3F6677_C063_4924_BF31_AA028A2DFDB8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫When I’m with Giselle... ⟪k:2⟫I ⟪k:3⟫am⟪k:4⟫ that.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫She makes me into the "
"person I always wanted to be."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Quando sto con Giselle... ⟪k:2⟫riesco ad esserlo.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Lei mi rende la persona che "
"ho sempre voluto essere."

#: scenario7:scenario7_CAF36A45_977B_4BD2_820A_243C32BC68BA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a327459233b21473e29a3a518bcd7e063b1519cb465b935a2bbab499776353b3
