#: scenario7:scenario7_6FC2541E_7EDE_4AA8_A380_23647591A82B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 60acdb1fda187743a4248c1b2caf04cf58ee6e766ec8ba34683db3dcc41848c5
