msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Haha... ⟪k:3⟫You came all the way up here ⟪k:4⟫just⟪k:5⟫ to tell me that?⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫"
"A needless formality."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Haha... ⟪k:3⟫Sei venuto fin quassù ⟪k:4⟫solo⟪k:5⟫ per dirmi questo?⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Che "
"inutile formalità."

