#: scenario7:scenario7_180E9105_D7F5_4671_98F6_65D3AADBD25C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 071c4188d8b79dd4dda3ff151697f7287973cc6d36b9aa1937d062236921570d
#. default-sha256: c785547af0fa0992483145b7388a7fe55ff51b096fae3e31b1bb0f3714ee027b
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_180E9105_D7F5_4671_98F6_65D3AADBD25C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Allow me to make a prediction before I depart, Michel,⟪k:3⟫cursed namesake of an "
"archangel."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Permettimi di fare una previsione prima di andarmene, Michel,⟪k:3⟫omonimo "
"maledetto di un arcangelo..."

#: scenario7:scenario7_9432002E_3B4C_4E54_A621_26ABC935A699
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 404ef9c171c37df39e4d8ca6c7b29053446585985ad2b3ae63a498a75e2dcfbe
#. default-sha256: 1ffb6d7c9495a90ebeb9cc594427682f253a8fd6df134a7f4142f187b94cc3e7
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_9432002E_3B4C_4E54_A621_26ABC935A699"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You may think that you’re making some sort of “progress,”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫but the fact of the "
"matter is, you’ve gone nowhere."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Potresti pensare che tu stia facendo qualche tipo di “progresso”,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ma la verità... "
"⟪k:3⟫è che non hai fatto alcun passo in avanti."

#: scenario7:scenario7_9B8B8197_CE62_4D65_87FC_E0E45E54C0B8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d02977412599cee343f99bd18df0546db87a114cfeef0780296166a11925b10b
#. default-sha256: 9725b0497891e7b24b9346eb2c3c734cec9a72ae05dde5f495c1860d112d6ab4
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_9B8B8197_CE62_4D65_87FC_E0E45E54C0B8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Will that smile of Giselle’s be able to withstand your secret?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Il sorriso di Giselle sarà in grado di far fronte al tuo segreto?"

