#: scenario7:scenario7_1E9B110A_9550_4EC5_8D3A_68C91CA85474
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bea0a20facfa14b71b37702b1f6d660354ea7a7eecdc1ea4173ce59a906d9deb
#. default-sha256: a359c248955f5864e6de6a69e305debbdb8c0b9bc4074b473b3565261d48535f
