msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫What ⟪k:1⟫did⟪k:2⟫ matter was that, despite likely questioning my sanity when I had first "
"told her about it, she hadn’t tried to pull away."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ciò che ⟪k:1⟫aveva⟪k:2⟫ importanza era che—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫sebbene avesse dubitato della mia "
"sanità mentale quando gliene avevo parlato la prima volta—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫non aveva tentato di "
"allontanarmi."

#: scenario7:scenario7_54937B5C_3963_425D_BCAC_D5A7E1C53EFE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
