msgid "⟪k:0⟫And ⟪k:1⟫that⟪k:2⟫ meant so much more than whether or not she believed in the witch."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E ⟪k:1⟫questo⟪k:2⟫ era molto più importante del fatto che credesse o meno nella strega."

#: scenario7:scenario7_529F6EBD_96C8_4123_A776_ED2C8823E58E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
