msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Having been born into this body, that was my reality, and there was nothing I could do to "
"change it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Essere nato in quel corpo—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫era quella la mia realtà, e non c’era nulla che potessi "
"fare per cambiarla."

#: scenario7:scenario7_C6CF68EE_7CA0_4A3F_BB82_D3533AEB0F2C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c222ba98139fd3aa9d215d166c513edaed04365eaf98115ca45e08aac5caf296
