"⟪k:0⟫and as much as I tried to tell myself I was just getting caught up in the moment, that the "
"feelings would pass in time,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫e per quanto provassi a dire a me stesso che mi ero solo fatto trascinare dal momento, e che "
"quelle sensazioni sarebbero passate col tempo,"

