#: scenario7:scenario7_CCF542C2_C99C_404A_BDAA_D528F80E096F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0418491647addaa2caab63aefd03aac44a1cc8decd4e9d83ed9ea079b318c358
