msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_CCF542C2_C99C_404A_BDAA_D528F80E096F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I prayed, from the bottom of my heart, that things would turn out for the best. ⟪k:1⟫That my "
"family would accept me for who I was, and that they would accept what I had with Giselle."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Pregai, dal profondo del cuore, che le cose andassero per il meglio. ⟪k:1⟫Che la mia "
"famiglia mi accettasse per quello che ero, e che accettasse⟪k:2⟫la mia relazione con Giselle."

#: scenario7:scenario7_A5CE85FB_1C46_4588_A207_ACFCBF415BD0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
