msgid "⟪k:0⟫I decided I would tell Giselle everything after I received their responses."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Decisi che avrei detto a Giselle ogni cosa subito dopo aver ricevuto⟪k:1⟫la loro risposta."

#: scenario7:scenario7_E61E2B72_11D6_430E_A56E_0D91B6C50A10
